1
00:00:01,509 --> 00:00:06,428
在低迷的房地产市场中 明智投资的五大秘诀就是
So the five keys to investing wisely in a down real estate market are...

2
00:00:06,488 --> 00:00:08,988
"诀"对保持冷静
KEYp your cool...

3
00:00:10,618 --> 00:00:13,238
"诀"对信息灵通
KEYp informed...

4
00:00:14,208 --> 00:00:15,558
腿脚勤快
Legwork.

5
00:00:15,558 --> 00:00:18,578
我刚成为一家新房地产公司的合伙人
I recently became a partner in a new agency,

6
00:00:18,588 --> 00:00:20,408
所以我要办个解说会
so I put together a seminar

7
00:00:20,408 --> 00:00:22,808
来吸引第一次买房的新手
to recruit first-time home buyers.

8
00:00:22,928 --> 00:00:24,967
我希望给他们一步步讲解
I want to give 'em a step-by-step description

9
00:00:24,967 --> 00:00:27,327
我如何帮他们选到满意的房子
of exactly what I can do for them.

10
00:00:27,327 --> 00:00:29,067
你问我会不会担心他们记下步骤后
Am I worried tha they might write it all down

11
00:00:29,067 --> 00:00:30,587
自己去挑选房子
and just do it themselves?

12
00:00:30,677 --> 00:00:34,187
坦白说 我现在才察觉到这个问题
Quite frankly, I hadn't thought about it until just now.

13
00:00:34,677 --> 00:00:35,937
我非得去参加吗
Do I really have to go to this thing?

14
00:00:35,937 --> 00:00:37,367
当然 你今天戏份大着呢
Yes. You're a big part of today.

15
00:00:37,367 --> 00:00:38,607
你是我的后勤人员
You're my support staff.

16
00:00:38,617 --> 00:00:40,457
那你为什么不付我工钱
Then why am I not getting paid?

17
00:00:40,977 --> 00:00:42,076
问得好
That is a good question.

18
00:00:42,076 --> 00:00:44,076
我会把答案用短信发到
And I think I'm gonna text you the answer

19
00:00:44,076 --> 00:00:45,366
我们买给你的手机上
on that cell phone we pay for.

20
00:00:45,366 --> 00:00:47,156
亲爱的 要再练习一下你的部分吗
Honey, do you wanna practice your part again?

21
00:00:47,156 --> 00:00:49,556
不 就一个问题而已 我记住了
Uh, no. It's just one question. I think I got it.

22
00:00:49,556 --> 00:00:51,226
是的 可那是最关键的问题
Yeah, but it's the most important question

23
00:00:51,226 --> 00:00:53,036
它将引出我的压轴好戏
because it launches me into my big finish.

24
00:00:53,036 --> 00:00:55,086
-没错 -那样人们会高高兴兴地离开
- Yes. - That way, people leave excited.

25
00:00:55,526 --> 00:00:58,056
我看是很高兴能离开吧
Oh, I think people will be excited to leave.

26
00:01:02,015 --> 00:01:03,225
卢克
Luke...

27
00:01:03,825 --> 00:01:04,595
你在干嘛
Why?

28
00:01:04,595 --> 00:01:06,565
抱歉 我是为了完成学校作业
I'm sorry. It's for school.

29
00:01:06,655 --> 00:01:08,975
我必须设计一个容器保护鸡蛋
I have to design a container that'll protect an egg

30
00:01:08,985 --> 00:01:09,955
从1层楼高处跌落而不摔碎
in a 1-story drop.

31
00:01:09,965 --> 00:01:10,995
好吧 所以
Yeah, so, um,

32
00:01:10,995 --> 00:01:13,435
你准备用包装鸡蛋的纸盒吗
you thought you would go with an egg carton?

33
00:01:13,435 --> 00:01:16,775
也许最佳方法就藏在我眼皮底下呢
What if the best idea was under my nose the whole time?

34
00:01:16,885 --> 00:01:18,504
你得下来把这一摊收拾干净
You're gonna need to come down and clean this up now.

35
00:01:18,504 --> 00:01:20,424
其实我本来完全不用瞎折腾的
Ugh! I wouldn't have to do any of this

36
00:01:20,424 --> 00:01:23,524
都怪艾丽克斯不肯让我用她当年上这课时的作品
if Alex would just let me use hers from when she took the class.

37
00:01:23,524 --> 00:01:24,174
门都没有
Never.

38
00:01:24,174 --> 00:01:26,764
那设计是我的知识产权
That design is my intellectual property.

39
00:01:26,764 --> 00:01:29,104
我觉得它足以应用在无人"驾"驶太空飞行上
I think it has applications for unmanned space flight.

40
00:01:29,104 --> 00:01:29,994
你再继续当科学怪胎
Keep talking like that

41
00:01:29,994 --> 00:01:31,844
一辈子都无人可"嫁"了
and you'll go through life unmanned.

42
00:01:31,844 --> 00:01:33,294
-真会搞笑 -姑娘们
- Funny. - Girls.

43
00:01:33,294 --> 00:01:34,594
卢克 亲爱的 听我说
Luke, honey, listen to me.

44
00:01:34,594 --> 00:01:36,713
你得独立完成这个作业
You're gonna need to do this project on your own.

45
00:01:36,713 --> 00:01:39,353
你能做到的 只要努力动动脑子
And you can do it. Just... really think.

46
00:01:39,713 --> 00:01:40,463
我想到了
I've got it!

47
00:01:40,463 --> 00:01:42,333
用我自身做容器如何
What if I'm the container?

48
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:43,953
算是个想法 你可以...
There's a thought. You could be...

49
00:01:44,303 --> 00:01:46,133
别 卢克 卢克
No, Luke! Luke!

50
00:02:08,062 --> 00:02:11,232
好 好 亲亲 爱你哦
Okay, si, te quiero. Mwah, mwah, mwah!

51
00:02:12,201 --> 00:02:13,981
我听懂了"疯老巫婆子"
I understood "Crazy old witch,"

52
00:02:13,981 --> 00:02:15,921
"去死吧" 以及 "爱你哦"
"Go kill yourself," Then "I love you."

53
00:02:15,931 --> 00:02:18,591
我一直搞不懂 你们家人怎么老互相嚷嚷
I'll never get this, how you all yell at each other.

54
00:02:18,991 --> 00:02:21,321
如何感受家人爱
That's how you know that your family loves you

55
00:02:21,321 --> 00:02:23,351
就在他们嚷你时
when they feel free to scream at you.

56
00:02:23,361 --> 00:02:25,221
那我应该对我前妻说声抱歉了
Oh, I guess I owe my ex-wife an apology.

57
00:02:25,221 --> 00:02:27,171
显然 她当年爱我爱得如痴如狂
Apparently,she was nuts about me.

58
00:02:28,581 --> 00:02:29,660
该死
Darn it!

59
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:31,200
下次在炒锅上试验吧
Try the next one over a frying pan.

60
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,780
正好给我当早饭
I could use some breakfast.

61
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:34,170
真让人丧气
This is so frustrating.

62
00:02:34,170 --> 00:02:36,040
至少你是在亲自动手做事
At least you're getting your hands dirty for a change.

63
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:38,710
平时都沉迷于精神世界 现在能动动手也不错
It is a nice break from the life of the mind I usually live.

64
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:40,040
说得很对
That's the spirit.

65
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:42,100
再说也是对人类境况的一种暗喻
Plus it's a metaphor for the human condition.

66
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:43,490
我们不都是易碎的鸡蛋吗
Aren't we all just fragile eggs

67
00:02:43,490 --> 00:02:45,250
躲藏在气泡垫的背后 虚张声势
hiding behind bubble wrap and bravado?

68
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:46,170
又回到老样子了
And we're back.

69
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:48,099
我保证你的鸡蛋坠落作品
Well, I'm sure that your egg-droppy thing

70
00:02:48,099 --> 00:02:49,919
会是全班最棒的
is going to be the best in the class.

71
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:51,149
肯定比不上卢克的
Except for Luke's.

72
00:02:51,149 --> 00:02:53,949
是吗 我们家卢克吗
Really? Our Luke?

73
00:02:54,099 --> 00:02:56,249
可他不是 有点...天然呆
But isn't he, like, a little, like...

74
00:02:56,259 --> 00:02:57,419
克莱尔肯定会帮他忙的
I bet Claire's gonna help him,

75
00:02:57,419 --> 00:03:00,519
就像上次美术课帮他画自画像一样
just like she did with his self-portrait for art class.

76
00:03:00,709 --> 00:03:02,319
那双眼睛囧囧有神
There was life in those eyes.

77
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:03,069
让人难以忘怀
It was haunting.

78
00:03:03,069 --> 00:03:05,308
那行 我要将此不正之风扼杀于萌芽中
Tell you what. I'm gonna nip this in the bud.

79
00:03:06,088 --> 00:03:08,128
你应该有公平竞争的机会
You deserve a fighting chance.

80
00:03:09,538 --> 00:03:12,658
我是为孩子们的那个鸡蛋坠落作业打来的
Hey, I'm calling about that, uh, egg project the boys are doing.

81
00:03:12,658 --> 00:03:14,268
家长不该插手帮忙 对吧
Parents aren't supposed to help out on that, right?

82
00:03:14,268 --> 00:03:16,048
家长干嘛要帮呢
Why would the parents be helping?

83
00:03:16,048 --> 00:03:17,778
那干嘛要帮8岁的孩子切葡萄呢
Why do they cut grapes for 8-year-olds?

84
00:03:17,778 --> 00:03:19,278
我觉得他们都会啃炸鸡条了
I figure if you can eat a chicken finger,

85
00:03:19,278 --> 00:03:20,678
肯定也能成功解决一颗葡萄
you can tear your way through a grape.

86
00:03:20,678 --> 00:03:21,568
又旧事重提吗 爸爸
Again, dad?

87
00:03:21,568 --> 00:03:23,047
抱歉 那事...
Oh, I'm sorry, it just...

88
00:03:23,057 --> 00:03:24,557
总让我不爽而已
bugs me, is all.

89
00:03:25,187 --> 00:03:27,277
我要说的是 我不会帮忙
The point is, I'm not helping,

90
00:03:27,277 --> 00:03:29,797
我希望大家也都别帮忙
and I hope no one else is helping, either.

91
00:03:29,797 --> 00:03:31,917
好吧 爸爸 多谢你提醒
Okay, dad. Thanks for the heads-up.

92
00:03:31,927 --> 00:03:33,987
爱你哦 再见
Love you. Bye-bye.

93
00:03:34,497 --> 00:03:36,727
我爸要帮曼尼做作业了
Well, my dad is doing Manny's project for him.

94
00:03:36,727 --> 00:03:38,107
他专门打电话来告诉你吗
He called to tell you that?

95
00:03:38,107 --> 00:03:40,457
不 他打来告诉我他不会帮忙
Oh, no. He called to tell me that he wasn't,

96
00:03:40,457 --> 00:03:42,726
那正是当你要插手帮忙时
which is exactly what you say when you are,

97
00:03:42,726 --> 00:03:44,606
又不想引人怀疑的说辞
but you don't want anybody to suspect it.

98
00:03:44,606 --> 00:03:46,046
是吗
Really?

99
00:03:46,076 --> 00:03:48,516
那你和你爸之间的问题又是什么说辞呢
What would you say if you had issues with your father?

100
00:03:48,516 --> 00:03:51,436
克莱尔和杰非常喜欢一较高低
Claire and Jay are incredibly competitive.

101
00:03:51,436 --> 00:03:54,036
网球比赛 扑克比赛 任何事
Tennis games, card games, everything.

102
00:03:54,046 --> 00:03:55,466
没人知道原因
Who knows why?

103
00:03:55,466 --> 00:03:57,996
克莱尔就像是我爸期望中的儿子
Claire is the son that my dad never had.

104
00:03:57,996 --> 00:04:00,825
他希望有个儿子一起在后院投球玩
I mean, he just wanted someone to throw a ball in the backyard.

105
00:04:01,615 --> 00:04:03,095
我投过一次 可是
I did once, but...

106
00:04:03,725 --> 00:04:05,235
他没有来
He did not attend.

107
00:04:07,065 --> 00:04:08,215
看起来挺有趣的
Looks like fun.

108
00:04:08,215 --> 00:04:09,715
开始是 可现在变难了
It was, but now it's hard.

109
00:04:09,715 --> 00:04:13,085
你一定能做得很好 老弟
Oh, I'm sure you're gonna do great, buddy...

110
00:04:15,765 --> 00:04:16,495
克莱尔
Claire?

111
00:04:16,495 --> 00:04:20,504
我只是对咱儿子的作品感兴趣
Uh, I am just showing interest in our son's project,

112
00:04:20,504 --> 00:04:21,724
任何家长都...
which any parent would--

113
00:04:21,724 --> 00:04:25,224
想想 好好想 我在想
Think! Think... to do. Thinking... I am,

114
00:04:25,224 --> 00:04:26,784
或许我应该留在这儿
that maybe I should stay here

115
00:04:26,784 --> 00:04:29,254
以防卢克有什么问题要问
in case Luke has any questions.

116
00:04:29,314 --> 00:04:30,834
你能找到其他什么人
Do you think you can find somebody else

117
00:04:30,834 --> 00:04:31,774
去帮你完成解说会吗
to help you with your seminar?

118
00:04:31,774 --> 00:04:33,694
估计不行吧 现在让我去哪儿找啊
I don't know. That's a little last-minute.

119
00:04:33,694 --> 00:04:35,553
你是不可替代的啊
You're kind of irreplaceable.

120
00:04:35,603 --> 00:04:37,563
我意思是说 反正就只有一个问题
Well, I mean, it's just one question,

121
00:04:37,563 --> 00:04:39,513
而且那个解说会也不会花太多时间
and the seminar isn't for a few hours...

122
00:04:40,403 --> 00:04:42,893
喂 歌洛莉亚 帮个小忙
Hey, Gloria? Quick favor.

123
00:04:44,293 --> 00:04:46,353
好吧 那边见 拜拜
Okay. See you there. Bye-bye.

124
00:04:46,353 --> 00:04:47,433
什么事
What was that?

125
00:04:47,483 --> 00:04:47,943
是菲尔
Phil.

126
00:04:47,953 --> 00:04:50,983
他请我去帮他完成一个解说会
He needs help with a seminar that he's giving.

127
00:04:50,983 --> 00:04:52,462
怎么不找克莱尔帮他
Why can't Claire help him?

128
00:04:52,762 --> 00:04:54,292
-他没说 -我告诉你为什么
- He didn't say. - I'll tell you why

129
00:04:54,292 --> 00:04:57,012
因为她投身于卢克的鸡蛋坠落实验了
because she's knee-deep in Luke's egg drop project.

130
00:04:57,012 --> 00:04:58,492
她说过不会插手帮忙的
She said that she was not going to help.

131
00:04:58,492 --> 00:05:00,162
那正是我对自己的惯用说辞
That's exactly what I would say to me

132
00:05:00,162 --> 00:05:02,482
用于我想帮孩子 又想骗自己说没插手的场合
if I was helping my kid and didn't want me to know.

133
00:05:02,482 --> 00:05:04,482
你为什么会跟自己说话
Why would you be talking to you?

134
00:05:04,482 --> 00:05:06,372
我只是说 那样对曼尼不公平
I'm just saying it's unfair to Manny.

135
00:05:06,372 --> 00:05:08,632
那孩子只靠自己是没希望赢的
The kid doesn't stand a chance on his own.

136
00:05:08,772 --> 00:05:09,862
我要插手了
I'm tagging in here.

137
00:05:09,862 --> 00:05:11,491
杰 他不需要你插手
Jay, he doesn't need you to baby him.

138
00:05:11,491 --> 00:05:12,961
我就给他一点点指导而已
I'm just gonna give him a few tips.

139
00:05:12,961 --> 00:05:14,451
孩子 去吃点东西
Kid, get yourself a snack.

140
00:05:14,451 --> 00:05:16,731
好吧 我给他切点葡萄
Okay, I'll cut him some grapes.

141
00:05:16,731 --> 00:05:17,431
别捣乱
Damn it!

142
00:05:17,431 --> 00:05:18,631
不是那种切片 杰
Not like that, Jay.

143
00:05:18,631 --> 00:05:20,391
是这样 瞧着
Like this. Look.

144
00:05:20,921 --> 00:05:22,771
那个能惹毛我 你懂的
It just irritates me, you know what I mean?

145
00:05:25,961 --> 00:05:27,951
我们近期在见一些孕妇 以预备将来领养
We're meeting with prospective birth mothers.

146
00:05:27,951 --> 00:05:29,280
我们曾有过一些类似的见面
We've had a few of these meetings,

147
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,600
那种事让人十分伤脑筋
and they're very nerve-racking.

148
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,700
你希望打扮得帅气迷人
You want to look good,

149
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:33,640
给对方留下良好的第一印象
You want to make a good first impression

150
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,810
有点像初次约会
kind of like a first date.

151
00:05:34,810 --> 00:05:37,030
事实上 跟初次约会正好相反
Actually, it's--it's the opposite of a first date.

152
00:05:37,030 --> 00:05:40,050
你不想做爱 但却希望直接要个孩子
You don't wanna have sex, but you do want a baby.

153
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:42,770
我必须承认 莉莉太可爱了
I have to say, Lily is adorable,

154
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:44,170
而且很能吃哦
and such a good eater.

155
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:45,570
并非总是如此
Oh, not all the time.

156
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:48,709
她只是喜欢我做的金枪鱼沙拉而已
She just happens to love my tuna salad.

157
00:05:48,829 --> 00:05:49,969
当然 我们没吃海豚
Dolphin safe, of course.

158
00:05:49,969 --> 00:05:51,689
谁在乎那个啦
Oh, who cares about that?

159
00:05:51,699 --> 00:05:53,759
我觉得海豚们介意
Well, I bet the dolphins do.

160
00:05:53,769 --> 00:05:56,749
你意思是说吃金枪鱼可以 吃海豚就不行
It's okay to eat tuna, but not dolphin?

161
00:05:56,749 --> 00:05:58,879
我却觉得 鱼就是鱼而已
My theory is, a fish is a fish.

162
00:05:59,619 --> 00:06:01,039
其实呢
Well...

163
00:06:01,169 --> 00:06:03,329
海豚实际上是哺乳动物 所以说
A dolphin's actually a mammal, so...

164
00:06:03,339 --> 00:06:04,538
就像番茄和西红柿 都一回事
Eh, to-may-to, to-mah-to.

165
00:06:04,538 --> 00:06:06,158
那番茄和母牛还一回事呢
More like tomato, cow.

166
00:06:06,158 --> 00:06:08,338
米奇 来厨房帮我弄一下司康饼
Mitchell, can you help me with the scones in the kitchen?

167
00:06:08,338 --> 00:06:09,378
好的
Okay.

168
00:06:09,658 --> 00:06:10,878
失陪一下
Excuse us.

169
00:06:12,478 --> 00:06:14,098
好吧 我们不是来弄司康饼的
Okay, this is not really about the scones.

170
00:06:14,098 --> 00:06:16,078
是吗 你一个人能拿得了六块饼吗
Oh, really? You didn't need help carrying six scones?

171
00:06:16,088 --> 00:06:18,048
不 问题是你得改掉
No, this is about your need to correct

172
00:06:18,058 --> 00:06:19,568
