00:13:01,305 --> 00:13:03,505
因为他永远不会生你的气
Oh, because he'll never get mad at you.

348
00:13:03,505 --> 00:13:05,435
他把你当女神一样膜拜
He totally puts you on a pedestal.

349
00:13:05,435 --> 00:13:06,275
才不是呢
That's not true.

350
00:13:06,285 --> 00:13:07,815
就是
Yeah, it is.

351
00:13:07,875 --> 00:13:09,835
我打电话到计程车公司叫车吧
Let me just call the cab company.

352
00:13:10,435 --> 00:13:13,065
计程车
Taxi!

353
00:13:13,115 --> 00:13:16,064
有那么难找吗 各位 红色的小卡片而已
It's not rocket science, people, it's just a little red card.

354
00:13:17,674 --> 00:13:21,004
好吧 看来没人需要鼠标垫
Okay. I guess nobody needs a mouse pad.

355
00:13:22,934 --> 00:13:25,924
我最爱的女儿在做什么呢
How's my favorite kid doing?

356
00:13:25,984 --> 00:13:27,164
最爱
Favorite?

357
00:13:27,224 --> 00:13:29,474
我知道 父母不该偏爱哪个孩子
Yeah, I know, we're not supposed to have favorites.

358
00:13:29,474 --> 00:13:30,874
可事实是 我们的确有偏爱
But you know what? We do.

359
00:13:30,874 --> 00:13:34,443
好消息是 宝贝疙瘩就是你
And the good news is, it's you.

360
00:13:35,043 --> 00:13:36,383
我不会把我的设计给你的
I'm not giving you my design.

361
00:13:36,383 --> 00:13:38,253
谁说要你白给了
Who said anything about giving?

362
00:13:38,483 --> 00:13:39,783
可以商量下条件嘛
We can work out an arrangement.

363
00:13:39,783 --> 00:13:41,083
你这是作弊
It's cheating.

364
00:13:41,083 --> 00:13:42,893
你想要什么 钱吗
What do you want? Money?

365
00:13:43,023 --> 00:13:44,723
我有点私房钱
I got a little something set aside.

366
00:13:45,193 --> 00:13:47,923
好吧 我根本不该给你提示的
Okay. I shouldn't even be giving you this hint,

367
00:13:47,923 --> 00:13:50,872
但是 首先找面镜子
but, first get a mirror.

368
00:13:50,912 --> 00:13:51,962
镜子
A mirror?

369
00:13:52,202 --> 00:13:53,172
接着你看向镜子
Then you're gonna look in it,

370
00:13:53,172 --> 00:13:54,392
你会看到一个疯婆子
and you're gonna see a crazy woman.

371
00:13:54,392 --> 00:13:56,052
她需要你的帮助
She needs your help.

372
00:13:57,002 --> 00:13:59,812
我产出的卵子[蛋]创造了你
You know, I made the egg that made you,

373
00:13:59,812 --> 00:14:01,292
你又产出了那个科学设计
that made that project,

374
00:14:01,292 --> 00:14:03,932
说来说去 你的设计本来就是属于我的
so in a lot of ways, that design is already mine!

375
00:14:06,022 --> 00:14:08,021
你挺好的
Oh, you're fine.

376
00:14:08,471 --> 00:14:14,391
大家确定没有任何问题了吗
Are you sure that there are no more questions?

377
00:14:14,391 --> 00:14:15,821
没问题了吗 很好
No more questions? Yes!

378
00:14:15,821 --> 00:14:19,651
请将麦克风递给那位大胡子先生
If we could just get that over to the mustachioed gentleman.

379
00:14:21,011 --> 00:14:21,781
我想问
Yes, I was--

380
00:14:21,781 --> 00:14:23,911
这声音大家都听烦了吧
Oh, hey, I think we're all tired of that sound.

381
00:14:23,911 --> 00:14:25,010
我走过来好了
Let me just come to you.

382
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:26,250
我敢肯定我知道你想问什么
I bet I know what your question is.

383
00:14:26,250 --> 00:14:27,570
你可能好奇
You're probably wondering

384
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:29,830
有第六把钥匙吗
if there's sixth key.

385
00:14:29,830 --> 00:14:30,730
不 我是想问
No, I was wondering about--

386
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:34,970
我是想问关于加急契约的问题
I was wondering about accelerated escrow.

387
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:36,260
如果买卖双方都愿意
If it works for both parties,

388
00:14:36,260 --> 00:14:38,090
可以加快过户速度
it's a great way to expedite the deal.

389
00:14:38,090 --> 00:14:39,830
回到你第一个问题
But back to your first question

390
00:14:39,830 --> 00:14:42,600
神秘的第六把钥匙
about this mysterious sixth key.

391
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,709
-我没说... -第六把钥匙
- I didn't say anything-- - The sixth key is the key

392
00:14:44,709 --> 00:14:47,789
就是以低于市场价购入新房的关键
to the new home that you purchased below market.

393
00:14:47,789 --> 00:14:51,829
利用你们今天所学到的简单原理
Using the simple principles that you learned here today...

394
00:14:51,829 --> 00:14:53,509
也不是那么简单 你们依然需要
But not so simple that you don't still need

395
00:14:53,509 --> 00:14:54,879
专业的房地产公司的服务
the professional services

396
00:14:54,879 --> 00:15:00,219
即沃斯南&肯尼利&邓菲公司
of Woosnum, Keneally... And Dunphy!

397
00:15:03,528 --> 00:15:04,828
感谢各位的光临
Thank you for coming.

398
00:15:07,328 --> 00:15:08,488
你妹的...
Son of a--

399
00:15:15,188 --> 00:15:17,778
关于我们 你还想了解什么
So is--is there anything that you'd like to know about us?

400
00:15:17,938 --> 00:15:19,197
我看不用了
I don't think so.

401
00:15:19,197 --> 00:15:22,027
事实上 我觉得不用再面试其他人了
In fact, I don't think I need to interview any more people.

402
00:15:22,027 --> 00:15:24,107
你们太合适了
You guys are perfect.

403
00:15:24,787 --> 00:15:26,617
你的意思是像我想的那样吗
Are--are you saying what I think you're saying?

404
00:15:26,617 --> 00:15:29,617
我不应该直接对你们说什么
I'm not supposed to say anything to you directly,

405
00:15:29,617 --> 00:15:33,367
但是 你们就等着好消息吧
but I think you guys should be expecting good news.

406
00:15:33,367 --> 00:15:35,507
我的天啊
Aah! Oh, gosh!

407
00:15:35,717 --> 00:15:37,196
了解 了解 你什么都没说
Oh, I know, I know, you're not saying anything!

408
00:15:37,196 --> 00:15:40,136
但你没说出口的话 是天大的好消息
But what you're not saying is wonderful!

409
00:15:40,136 --> 00:15:42,306
好了 我去拿起泡苹果酒
Um, all right. I'm gonna get some sparkling cider?

410
00:15:42,316 --> 00:15:43,546
好的 好的
Yes, yes. Okay, okay.

411
00:15:43,556 --> 00:15:45,416
没有苹果酒就没有庆祝氛围
It wouldn't be a celebration without cider

412
00:15:45,416 --> 00:15:47,466
没有庆祝之歌也一样
or a celebratory song.

413
00:15:47,466 --> 00:15:50,016
不过这次 我希望你坐在这里
But this time, I want you to sit right here.

414
00:15:50,026 --> 00:15:50,926
坐下吧
So have a seat here.

415
00:15:50,926 --> 00:15:54,585
把你乱掉的头发拂到肩后
Let's just get this mop out of the way there.

416
00:16:00,075 --> 00:16:02,575
*如果你现在离我而去*
*If you leave me now*

417
00:16:02,695 --> 00:16:07,685
*你将带走我人生的大部分意义*
*You'll take away the biggest part of me*

418
00:16:09,215 --> 00:16:14,524
*不要 宝贝 求你别走*
*Ooh, ooh, ooh, no, baby, please don't go*

419
00:16:15,104 --> 00:16:21,244
*不要 我只想要你留下*
*Ooh, ooh, ooh, no, I just want you to stay*

420
00:16:25,494 --> 00:16:28,174
没错 她很伤心 不过往好处想
Yes, she was upset, but on a positive note,

421
00:16:28,174 --> 00:16:31,573
从此事中得到的结论就是 我的歌声很能打动人
what I take from this experience is, I can sing.

422
00:16:31,583 --> 00:16:33,833
从此事中我们没得到的 是孩子
Uh, what we didn't take away from the experience is a baby,

423
00:16:33,833 --> 00:16:35,983
人家决定留下孩子自己养
Because she decided to keep it.

424
00:16:39,813 --> 00:16:42,643
不好 我们完全错过了吗
No. Did we missed everything?

425
00:16:42,653 --> 00:16:45,143
是的 来宾都迅速退场了
Yeah. They cleared out of here pretty fast.

426
00:16:45,143 --> 00:16:46,033
扫兴
Bummer.

427
00:16:46,033 --> 00:16:47,173
又岂止扫兴 海莉
More than a bummer, Haley.

428
00:16:47,173 --> 00:16:49,212
此次推广对我来说很重要 却被你弄砸了
This was really important to me, and you blew it.

429
00:16:49,212 --> 00:16:50,512
不 菲尔 全是我的错
Ay, no, Phil, it was my fault.

430
00:16:50,512 --> 00:16:52,162
不关她的事
It was not her fault.

431
00:16:52,452 --> 00:16:54,002
算了 木已成舟
Okay. What's done is done.

432
00:16:54,002 --> 00:16:56,232
你把宣传册子拿上车吧
Can you take the brochures out to the car?

433
00:16:56,532 --> 00:16:58,062
满满一盒都没动
Wow. It's still full.

434
00:16:58,062 --> 00:16:59,402
是的
Yeah, it is.

435
00:16:59,632 --> 00:17:01,582
推广效果不好吗
So it was not very good?

436
00:17:01,582 --> 00:17:03,542
不好
Um... no.

437
00:17:04,152 --> 00:17:05,462
我得打扫这里
I kind of need to sweep here.

438
00:17:05,462 --> 00:17:08,751
好的 不过我真的很抱歉 菲尔
Okay. But--but I'm so sorry, Phil.

439
00:17:08,811 --> 00:17:09,771
没关系
It's okay.

440
00:17:09,781 --> 00:17:11,181
不 有关系
No, it's not okay.

441
00:17:11,191 --> 00:17:14,301
我们迟到了 我们毁了你的解说会
We came late and we ruined your whole presentation.

442
00:17:14,311 --> 00:17:15,401
人都有倒霉的时候
These things happen.

443
00:17:15,401 --> 00:17:17,491
没错 可这个时候一般人都会发火
Yeah, it happens, and people get angry.

444
00:17:17,491 --> 00:17:18,871
歌洛莉亚 没事的
Gloria, it's fine.

445
00:17:18,871 --> 00:17:19,761
不 有事
No, it's not fine!

446
00:17:19,761 --> 00:17:21,091
我努力与你沟通
I'm trying to have a real conversation,

447
00:17:21,091 --> 00:17:23,650
而你却把我当女神一样膜拜
and all you do is put me on a pedestal!

448
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,130
等等 你在生我的气吗
Wait a minute. You'mad at me?

449
00:17:28,130 --> 00:17:30,030
是的 因为家人之间
Yes, because that's not how family's

450
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:31,640
不应该是这种态度
supposed to treat each other!

451
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:33,270
你知道家人之间应该是什么态度吗
You know how family's supposed to treat each other?

452
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:35,670
家人之间应该为对方考虑
They're supposed to actually think about each other!

453
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,860
我求你帮一个忙
I asked you to do one thing...

454
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,540
但你却这么自私 这么不负责任
And you were too selfish and irresponsible

455
00:17:38,540 --> 00:17:40,580
连一天都不支持我 信不信由你
to come through for me on a day that, believe it or not,

456
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:42,429
今天对我真的很重要
was really important to me!

457
00:17:43,509 --> 00:17:46,179
天哪 你居然哭了 真对不起
Oh, my god. You're crying. I'm so sorry.

458
00:17:46,189 --> 00:17:48,519
不 这正是我想要的
No! That's what I want!

459
00:17:48,519 --> 00:17:51,709
你吼我是因为爱我
You yell at me because you love me!

460
00:17:51,709 --> 00:17:53,499
你惹我生气了嘛
Well, you made me mad.

461
00:17:53,499 --> 00:17:54,719
你生气也是应该的
And you should be.

462
00:17:54,729 --> 00:17:56,539
好吧 我已经不气了
Well, I'm not anymore.

463
00:17:56,539 --> 00:17:57,669
别把我不当家人嘛 菲尔
Don't treat me like that, Phil.

464
00:17:57,669 --> 00:17:58,859
因为我现在出离愤怒了
Because now I'm furious!

465
00:17:58,859 --> 00:18:01,738
噢 这才是我的亲人
Ay, mi familia! Si.

466
00:18:01,738 --> 00:18:03,628
你怎么能这样呢
Oh, how do you do that?

467
00:18:03,628 --> 00:18:04,938
你真是...
It makes me so...

468
00:18:05,468 --> 00:18:06,528
气死我了
Mad.

469
00:18:08,618 --> 00:18:10,978
对一个13岁孩子来说 手工做的相当不错啊
That's a pretty nice piece of handiwork for a 13-year-old.

470
00:18:10,978 --> 00:18:11,978
是啊 卢克做的也很好啊
Yeah, Luke did pretty good, too,

471
00:18:11,978 --> 00:18:14,158
毕竟平时他脱下书包都需要人帮助
for a kid who still needs help getting out of his backpack.

472
00:18:14,158 --> 00:18:16,328
-他可是您外孙啊 -怒其不争啊
- Still your grandson. - Felt bad when I said it.

473
00:18:16,328 --> 00:18:17,128
我们开始吧
Okay, let's do this.

474
00:18:17,128 --> 00:18:18,537
孩子们看着点儿 扔下来了哦
Watch out, kids! They're coming down!

475
00:18:18,537 --> 00:18:20,467
一 二 三
One, two, three.

476
00:18:22,947 --> 00:18:24,077
怎么样
How'd we do?

477
00:18:25,087 --> 00:18:26,457
两只蛋都完好无损
Both eggs are okay.

478
00:18:26,457 --> 00:18:27,717
太好了 看来我们都是赢家
Great. So we both win.

479
00:18:27,717 --> 00:18:28,687
无法接受
Unacceptable.

480
00:18:28,687 --> 00:18:29,567
我们升级一层楼吧
We're going up another level.

481
00:18:29,567 --> 00:18:31,037
没错 来吧 三楼了哈
Absolutely. Come on. Third floor.

482
00:18:31,037 --> 00:18:32,357
艾丽克斯 上来找我们 走吧
Meet us there, Alex. Let's go.

483
00:18:32,357 --> 00:18:33,077
等等
Wait.

484
00:18:33,077 --> 00:18:34,417
没这必要啊
You don't have to do this.

485
00:18:34,417 --> 00:18:36,266
作业是从一层楼高扔下来就行的
The assignment was for a 1-story drop.

486
00:18:36,266 --> 00:18:37,306
我们都能得到A
We both get A's.

487
00:18:37,316 --> 00:18:38,546
就按我们说的办
We're doing this.

488
00:18:40,786 --> 00:18:42,006
真讨厌
I don't like this.

489
00:18:42,026 --> 00:18:43,346
他俩在一起一合计
The two of them talking up there--

490
00:18:43,346 --> 00:18:44,866
肯定会发现我们的诡计
they're gonna figure out what we did.

491
00:18:44,866 --> 00:18:46,396
我们是迫不得已
We did what we had to.

492
00:18:46,396 --> 00:18:47,776
我们会被抓现行的
We're gonna get caught.

493
00:18:48,876 --> 00:18:49,736
看看他们
Look at them down there.

494
00:18:49,736 --> 00:18:51,336
他俩压根就不关心
They're not even paying attention.

495
00:18:51,336 --> 00:18:52,886
现在才是最精彩的嘛
This is the best part.

496
00:18:53,235 --> 00:18:55,245
事实上 曼尼好像挺不乐意的
Actually, Manny looks kind of upset.

497
00:18:55,255 --> 00:18:57,555
他不乐意啥 他马上要让卢克好看了哎
Why would he be? He's about to kick Luke's butt.

498
00:18:57,555 --> 00:18:58,425
拉倒吧
Oh, knock it off.

499
00:18:58,425 --> 00:19:00,095
卢克和曼尼在这个项目中根本毫无付出
Luke and Manny had as much to do with this project

500
00:19:00,095 --> 00:19:02,215
就好比曼哈顿计划跟他们完全无关一样
as they did with the Manhattan Project.

501
00:19:02,975 --> 00:19:04,415
你觉得是这么回事吗
You think that's what's going on?

502
00:19:04,415 --> 00:19:06,345
他们烦是因为我们抢了他们的活儿
They're upset because we took over for them?

503
00:19:06,345 --> 00:19:07,295
也许吧
Maybe.

504
00:19:07,295 --> 00:19:09,355
他们本该从中学到东西
They were supposed to--to learn from this,

505
00:19:09,355 --> 00:19:11,704
却被我们毁的干干净净
and--and we ruined it.

506
00:19:11,704 --> 00:19:13,094
-我们应该去跟他俩谈谈 -没错
- We should go talk to them. - Yeah.

507
00:19:17,844 --> 00:19:19,044
孩子们 我们谈谈吧
Boys, we need to talk.

508
00:19:19,044 --> 00:19:20,654
天哪 天啊
Oh, god. Oh, god.

509
00:19:20,654 --> 00:19:21,754
淡定点
Just stay frosty.

510
00:19:21,754 --> 00:19:24,714
我们明白了一些事情
So, uh, we realized couple things up there,

511
00:19:24,714 --> 00:19:26,524
我觉得该道歉了
and I think apologies are in order.

512
00:19:26,524 --> 00:19:28,124
好吧 我们坦白
Ok, we admit it.

513
00:19:28,284 --> 00:19:30,793
我们使计让你们替我们做这个任务来着
We tricked you into doing our projects for us.

514
00:19:31,033 --> 00:19:31,563
什么
What?

515
00:19:31,563 --> 00:19:33,933
我也是才知道的
This is the first I'm hearing of this.

516
00:19:33,943 --> 00:19:35,063
我们知道如果要让你们把活儿全都揽下来
We knew you'd do all the work

517
00:19:35,063 --> 00:19:37,173
就得让你们之间相互较劲儿
if you thought you were competing with each other.

518
00:19:37,173 --> 00:19:39,163
所以我告诉你 克莱尔可能在帮卢克的忙
So I told you I thought Claire was helping Luke,

519
00:19:39,163 --> 00:19:40,203
然后你就打给了克莱尔
and then you called Claire...

520
00:19:40,203 --> 00:19:41,453
所以就这么把我扯进来了...
which got me involved, and...

521
00:19:41,453 --> 00:19:43,003
行了 接下来这样子
All right. Here's what's gonna happen--

522
00:19:43,233 --> 00:19:45,443
你给我上车 我们马上开车回家
You're gonna get in the car, we're gonna drive home,

523
00:19:45,523 --> 00:19:48,442
然后你们各做各的 自己动手
and you're each gonna do your own projects.

524
00:19:48,442 --> 00:19:49,522
好吧
Fine.

525
00:19:52,732 --> 00:19:55,452
说到底 都是你的错
You know, this is your fault.

526
00:19:55,462 --> 00:19:55,992
什么
What?

527
00:19:55,992 --> 00:19:58,522
我们父女一直争来争去 太病态了
The way we compete with each other it's--is sick.

528
00:19:58,522 --> 00:20:00,092
极度不正常 就连俩十三岁的孩子
It's so sick, two 13-year-olds

529
00:20:00,092 --> 00:20:01,122
都知道怎么利用我们这点
Know how to take advantage of us.

530
00:20:01,122 --> 00:20:03,792
而且 其实 是你把我变成这样的
And you know what? You made me this way.

531
00:20:03,792 --> 00:20:05,041
你怎么能这么想
How do you figure that?

532
00:20:05,641 --> 00:20:07,441
老爸 你逼着我参加体育运动
Dad! You pushed me into sports.

533
00:20:07,441 --> 00:20:09,101
但却从来不让我赢 这种事情
You never let me win. You know, that stuff--

534
00:20:09,101 --> 00:20:10,661
对女孩子是会有影响的
it does something to a girl.

535
00:20:10,661 --> 00:20:13,371
在我看来 你天生就是这么争强好胜啊
For your information, you came out of the womb like that.

536
00:20:13,371 --> 00:20:15,551
我有时都怀疑 你妈怀的是不是双胞胎
I'm not entirely sure there wasn't a twin in there

537
00:20:15,551 --> 00:20:16,821
另一个被你在子宫里干掉了
you bumped off.

538
00:20:16,881 --> 00:20:19,661
如果你早看出我这性格 为何不纠正我
If you saw that in me, why didn't you discourage it?

539
00:20:19,661 --> 00:20:21,791
我为什么要纠正我爱的东西
Why would I discourage something that I love?

540
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,000
真的吗
Really?

541
00:20:24,050 --> 00:20:25,040
开什么玩笑
You kidding?

542
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:26,340
你可是个斗士
You're a fighter.

543
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:29,020
我爱的就是你这种永不放弃的个性
The thing I love about you is you never give up.

544
00:20:30,220 --> 00:20:33,760
老爸
Dad.

545
00:20:33,770 --> 00:20:36,100
尽管我的设计明显比你的好
Even though I clearly designed a superior egg container.

546
00:20:36,100 --> 00:20:37,340
又在说疯话 老头
Out of your mind, old man.

547
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:38,680
只有一种方法能证明
Only one way to find out.

548
00:20:42,729 --> 00:20:43,309
放弃吧
Give up.

549
00:20:43,309 --> 00:20:45,079
你俩再怎么争都只能得第二
You're all just playing for second.

550
00:20:47,849 --> 00:20:49,229
那妞也遗传了点不正常基因
There's something wrong with that one.

551
00:20:53,139 --> 00:20:54,339
我才没有不正常
I'm not wrong.

552
00:20:54,339 --> 00:20:56,309
老妈有时候很疯狂 对吧
Mom can be crazy, right?

553
00:20:56,319 --> 00:20:57,799
喂
Hello!

554
00:20:58,508 --> 00:20:59,888
谢谢你
Thank you.

555
00:21:00,218 --> 00:21:03,728
但是生她气的同时 我也挺内疚的
At the same time, I feel guilty when I get mad at her.

556
00:21:03,728 --> 00:21:05,378
我不觉得那算古怪啊
I don't think that's weird.

557
00:21:05,378 --> 00:21:06,978
我真为我的手工骄傲
Just really proud of my project.

558
00:21:06,978 --> 00:21:08,148
我可不想与人分享
I don't wanna share it.

559
00:21:08,148 --> 00:21:10,028
每个人都有自己的癖好嘛
Everybody has his own thing.

560
00:21:10,618 --> 00:21:12,128
谢谢你 海莉
Thanks, Haley.

561
00:21:12,158 --> 00:21:13,508
我知道这么说挺傻的
I know it might sound dorky,

562
00:21:13,508 --> 00:21:16,737
但与你的深夜长谈对我来说很有意义
but this late-night conversations really mean a lot to me.

563
00:21:16,947 --> 00:21:18,217
只有在此时我才觉得...
They're the only time that I feel like I...

564
00:21:18,227 --> 00:21:20,527
好吧 科瑞 就一张照片哦
Ok, Corey, just one picture.

565
00:21:20,527 --> 00:21:21,647
稍等
Hold on.

566
00:21:22,677 --> 00:21:25,427
从这个角度看我的脚好胖啊
My feet look fat from this angle.

567
00:21:25,547 --> 00:21:27,157
艾丽克斯 醒醒
Hey, Alex, wake up.

568
00:21:27,157 --> 00:21:29,407
帮忙给我的脚拍张照片吧
I need you to take a picture for my feet.
